{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01502",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.02,
      "end_seconds": 9.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.18,
      "end_seconds": 18.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "It's a tingling lip then a blister. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.74,
      "end_seconds": 21.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 39.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.54,
      "text": "Um, about... well, two months. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.46,
      "end_seconds": 43.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Did you notice any eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.11,
      "end_seconds": 48.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any eye pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.9,
      "end_seconds": 53.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fever, sores in the mouth or rash elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.24,
      "end_seconds": 61.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, sores in the mouth or rash elsewhere, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.73,
      "end_seconds": 65.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 70.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I mean, uh, no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.59,
      "end_seconds": 73.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.54,
      "end_seconds": 75.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.33,
      "end_seconds": 79.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.37,
      "end_seconds": 86.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.18,
      "end_seconds": 92.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.96,
      "end_seconds": 98.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Yes, amoxicillin. I get a rash all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.67,
      "end_seconds": 102.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.71,
      "end_seconds": 105.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.27,
      "end_seconds": 121.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.95,
      "end_seconds": 139.56,
      "duration_seconds": 14.61,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.46,
      "end_seconds": 144.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.99,
      "end_seconds": 160.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.66,
      "end_seconds": 180.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 109 over 73, respiratory rate 16, heart rate 78. And oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.6,
      "end_seconds": 187.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.83,
      "end_seconds": 209.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Yes, uh, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.5,
      "end_seconds": 211.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.92,
      "end_seconds": 234.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "There is a small cluster of blisters on the edge of the upper lip."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.87,
      "end_seconds": 242.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Okay, all finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.81,
      "end_seconds": 268.54,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is a cold sore. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.03,
      "end_seconds": 271.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.98,
      "end_seconds": 293.38,
      "duration_seconds": 20.4,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a cold sore, and we'll watch how it goes. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a tingling lip then a blister for two months, and no fever or sores in the mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.13,
      "end_seconds": 296.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.35,
      "end_seconds": 331.26,
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "text": "The treatment will be aciclovir cream, 5%, five times a day, five days. That should help with cold sore. Avoid kissing and sharing towels until it has crusted over. I'd like you back if not healed in ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.61,
      "end_seconds": 336.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.55,
      "end_seconds": 340.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.82,
      "end_seconds": 345.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Um, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.48,
      "end_seconds": 347.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}